<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>电气 on Aliya の 笔记</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/categories/%E7%94%B5%E6%B0%94/</link><description>Recent content in 电气 on Aliya の 笔记</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><atom:link href="https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/categories/%E7%94%B5%E6%B0%94/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>电压并列（母线PT二次电压并列）</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E7%94%B5%E5%8E%8B%E5%B9%B6%E5%88%97%E6%AF%8D%E7%BA%BFpt%E4%BA%8C%E6%AC%A1%E7%94%B5%E5%8E%8B%E5%B9%B6%E5%88%97/</link><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 14:35:14 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E7%94%B5%E5%8E%8B%E5%B9%B6%E5%88%97%E6%AF%8D%E7%BA%BFpt%E4%BA%8C%E6%AC%A1%E7%94%B5%E5%8E%8B%E5%B9%B6%E5%88%97/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-167.avif" alt="Featured image of post 电压并列（母线PT二次电压并列）" />双母线并列运行时，把两段母线 PT 的二次电压回路并联起来，让母线上所有保护/测量都能取到电压——顺带讲清它和「电压切换」「同期并列」的区别。</description></item><item><title>发电机励磁控制</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E5%8F%91%E7%94%B5%E6%9C%BA%E5%8A%B1%E7%A3%81%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 23:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E5%8F%91%E7%94%B5%E6%9C%BA%E5%8A%B1%E7%A3%81%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-002.avif" alt="Featured image of post 发电机励磁控制" />通过调节转子励磁电流，控制机端电压、无功功率与系统稳定性。含励磁方式、AVR 调节、OEL/UEL/V-Hz 限制、强励与 PSS。</description></item></channel></rss>